      "note": "gl_je Required on forecast/aggregate leaves that structurally cannot carry a JE link: home is a pure tab-shell (chrome, zero content of its own); tab.daily_prediction reads getDailyPrediction (a forward-looking forecast -- no posted JE exists yet for a projected future cash movement); tab.actual_vs_projected reads getActualVsProjected, whose AvpLineItem rows are per-DATE aggregates (date+category+projected/actual/variance cents, no id field) summing potentially dozens of underlying JEs per day -- there is no single JE a daily rollup row can drill to. Verified live: none of the three files contain any EntityLink or journal_entry reference.",
